        "## Exercises"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "1. Take one of your production failures. Write an eval case that reproduces it. Does your agent pass it now?\n2. Build an LLM-judge rubric for your domain with three dimensions (factual, tone, scope). Score 50 sessions.\n3. Wire the eval suite into CI. Fail the build on >=5% regression.\n4. Add a trajectory-efficiency metric: how many steps did the agent take vs a gold trajectory?\n5. Map every Phase 14 lesson to an eval case in your suite. Any missing? That's a gap to close."
